% shows it the same way. Functional families by fill: interrupt vectors (yellow),
% PA/PB/PTRA/PTRB pointers (green), I/O DIR/OUT/IN (peach). Self-contained numbered
% figure (caption = title); \diagramscale keeps it natural-size and centered.
